{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1514bca954507da6077cc47dfe99e0c4746f3602a85cbf7aa8e46ad417177ecf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c60912cbfe53b8a215d6b05194776c66f33af20f9eeb0c8b5ad5268cfff719b6"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"The system natively supports the Model Context Protocol (MCP) and is described as behaving consistently across Web, CLI, and IM front-ends.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_29121366b984960178770f2b86797f3182694daa76db2f8371223a4b1998b4fa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_318db432a992f199b906e5d228af5e3de2e3cd0039372018fc60ecfc857827a7","slc_616b8a95e79a446d78a5e00b78a2dd7155f2236f6aa488b823cb1b94831ea777","slc_c5b144fd205d719a0b8ff4f83d47f3173840dfa5a55b74dc4d8dee6c35d516d6"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"The installer requires Node.js 22.13+ and below v23 for the built-in SQLite runtime, and the Windows installer checks node:sqlite support and uses prebuilt native packages such as node-pty, better-sqlite3, bcrypt, and sharp.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_330c7d586383df4b4d3f15f05bb7ed63bc959977788cd8f00361dc0437651d4a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_23dbc364823e508feb68a01c7cdda73798b4d05a7e718639962a0d185b2134b5","slc_c60912cbfe53b8a215d6b05194776c66f33af20f9eeb0c8b5ad5268cfff719b6"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"The WorkSpace is the fundamental isolation unit: each project gets its own file system, memory store, and skill set, so parallel work does not interfere and retrieval stays scoped.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_353d9a7d81fda036d67aa24bbca27f16df3d8c815e80f383cdcc589a5cb11f7e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c9dd785e997c57712ecacb01de615e499217ec0c797b851aa4501c026a42c30c"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"PilotDeck is an open-source agent operating system organized around a 'WorkSpace' concept, jointly developed by THUNLP, ModelBest, OpenBMB, and AI9Stars, targeting general-purpose multi-task scenarios.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3fca21040a10f86abb1ad201431e9a5425c52d01470b0fb53b7b7516b4e47214","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4b4ae95c421188c3cc8a3a830112998aa17d3c979c3fe2399b260e6153915d76"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"Smart Routing auto-detects task difficulty and sends complex calls to flagship models while simple tasks go to lighter sub-agent models, aiming to reduce token cost.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_46f587a7b683a4f1df69d9c6499f7610eaf58734ad6090d611497fbaec330ea4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2aaab013d800eb79d4d7f0e522c7dc04f8e4200b05617b9cea97f92074ec50c3","slc_71e74652fcf525aa5b5fee7f3a1e1c893940101e64c285e8564259964cd55a75","slc_97c5b3d5b2ce5f68ea0fa34b5e91764afd252a2d78938a802f1ec5549ebabc14","slc_f616445e7c56276c39c9c299dccfce1f891054ac60401448b2caecdba24b550d"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"The README reports benchmarks: on 7 complex tasks, a Sonnet 4.6 main plus MiniMax-M2.7 sub setup scored 70.6 at $3.15 versus 69.1 at $18.36 for a Sonnet 4.6 single agent, and Smart Routing cut a social-media workload's cost from $12.58 to $2.83.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6524358f8ea020f90c44269c575966149d3434d89aee58b1e6133b3ae65c0c51","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ae37a06a2cf6b098837d62c366e43c33a96245f9c924520147f91dbd6dc91753","slc_b4df8752c97ac800265ed3f0d6f72e723148b123227e3a795ce210cccd59c48e"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"Configuration is read from ~/.pilotdeck/pilotdeck.yaml; if the file is missing, the Web UI starts without the Gateway, and saving a valid provider and key writes the config and starts the Gateway automatically.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7f1d60229243aa44a3a735bef6e286a2059571f7dd5c510c5a9e8bf18861b637","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_437061b9369eee3b97fbf8994242d7992cd54ac56eeb74a680c1ded11c0dc6a1","slc_7ed2728f0eb51637d34156d99e100c0e0adbdfadfd71eb5472429405199b1d1e","slc_881be3a36093e8773405db18304a114b1ea54fb6b93d907e58747f6fdbeb106b"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"Repository development practice: source installs use corepack pnpm with a committed pnpm-lock.yaml and workspace filters, and Git LFS demo media is skipped by default for a lightweight clone.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_80c3f6bbe92b22ca892cc8aa682d73d0d7e22c2e5333ed8efdc9fc95a2b26f91","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5714b968c6fc608c2c4e97983a4333f81aa798491c2d748024d36ed7b187b199","slc_945b5559f2211757e856ce789fb9be45747d7a0029d0118a4688fd05d18c6be4"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"Memory is white-box and traceable: generation, extraction, storage, and retrieval are visible, entries can be edited or deleted, and a Dream Mode consolidates memory in idle windows with one-click rollback.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_990900e6c75a742ff4b2374cdf41f966989cdd96f3cedc57301a713e5a858d37","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e42e29b6b5df186d6d478e12aec53651afb7674bf9f83f82f1ab52042248f7ed"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"The system supports always-on background execution: after the user signs off, the agent continues discovering tasks, running long-horizon monitors, and writing deliverables as local files with a summary report.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c49998f58098f61fcbb321b230105bd82a5b7f69bed7607b0bd060939eff54eb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0d923e866952d033c65aca76cf3ce75494439248791f3322ab8257fe0033dcce","slc_1ae6ece43fc8bd98f3e69859d887494d07b23a91160573332d511ee3ffc0bd70"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"PilotDeck ships a Web UI with WorkSpace management, white-box memory editing, and visualization of multi-agent collaboration; the 'pilotdeck' command starts the server at http://localhost:3001.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dffb020f6f5d6e1f8ada354fc07232594384f67d49a0e9626e78b0713830f1bf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"openbmb/pilotdeck@97633a08a73e snapshot 2d0f9ca69f85ae00","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_986fb4fc6f34586dd6e9a8aae7f1c301f580c7dd1805747f6407c0e67a24f5d8","slc_c2c6a863e6e76d7359a126540810b8c9f08f143b910422acfe95faa82f491ef5"],"source_ids":["src_feb76105800d589e9fbe93288d71fd7f"],"text":"An open plugin architecture separates the open-source core from plugin customization, supporting MCP servers, custom tools and skills, lifecycle hooks such as PreToolUse and UserPromptSubmit, and pluggable memory store providers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:26:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea48b5e3effc4110bf0d82e07a9ead1f"}
